    "image_with_text_abrnbL": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_wkhRGc": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "MADE IN MELBOURNE, ALWAYS",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_XyYwiR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Once your design is finalised and your diamond or gemstone is selected, William will provide a bespoke 3D rendering of your engagement ring for your approval.<br/><br/>Each ring is then meticulously handcrafted by William in our Melbourne studio. From the precision of stone setting to the final polish, every stage is overseen with uncompromising attention to detail, ensuring a piece of lasting beauty and refinement.<br/><br/>Production timeframe & our promise to you:<br/>•  Production: 2–4 weeks<br/>•  A complimentary resizing<br/>•  Complimentary lifetime cleaning<br/>•  WILLIAM ÉDOUARD premium engagement warranty<br/><br/></p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
